$Id: ambient.notes,v 1.203 2022/03/11 12:43:39 piru Exp $

11.03.2022
 - Fixed classic icon normalization (it was broken by 08.01.2022 change) (piru)

10.01.2022
 - Fixed iconinfo arexx command double reply (use-after-free). (piru)

09.01.2022
 - Fixed several SetAttrs() calls with unterminated taglists. (piru)

08.01.2022
 - Hopefully fixed deficons related rendering corruption when zooming icons down
   or resetting the zoom level from large size to normal (ctrl+middlebutton).
   (piru)
 - Added a workaround for the duplicate volume/assign icons appearing on the My
   MorphOS views on disk removal. (piru)

01.01.2022
 - Fixed a long standing bug where icon preview playback could be applied to
   non-icon objects, leading to use-after-free. (piru)

30.12.2021
 - Fixed a race condition in the icon preview playback thread. It failed to
   retain the iconobj it was animating, leading to use-after-free. (piru)
 - Fixed to not leak SVG icon bitmaps on icon resize. (piru)
 - Made icon resize more robust on error conditions. (piru)

23.12.2021
 - Attempt to fix race conditions in CACHETAG_THUMBNAIL.
 - Don't use semaphore protected memory in cache code in order to avoid breaking
   forbid in the low mem handler. (piru)

1.1.2019
 - copyright.h
   Bumped COPYRIGHTYEAR_END to 2019. (cyfm)

21.08.2018
 - Added option to enable transition effect (default is off). (itix)

11.08.2018
 - Fixed inconsistent viewer behaviour. (itix)

05.08.2018
 - Tweaked copy read buffer size again (now back to 8MB). (itix)

26.07.2018
 - Create folder window now reacts to F-keys. (itix)

24.07.2018
 - Reduced memory usage in filecopy with small improvement to copy performance. (itix)

06.04.2017
 - No longer crashes when using F-keys in requesters. (itix)
 - No longer hits when attempting to rename nothing. (itix)
 - Fixed to rescan filetype when certain file protection bits have changed. (itix)

03.09.2016
 - Fixed issue with iconless icon reading after reboot. (itix)

12.08.2016
 - Icons in list views are now updated if they changed. (itix)

11.08.2016
 - Added "Create icon" button to information window.
   Added "Get default" to retrieve default icon.
   Fixed memory leak if there was no file associated with the icon. (itix)

09.08.2016
 - Now information window confirms if default icon should be created if
   meta data is edited. (itix)

01.08.2016
 - Imageless PNG icons. It is now possible save tooltypes and other metadata to
   objects with default icon. New icon is created without an image (Ambient will
   load deficon as default image) but user can change icon to real icon at any
   time. (itix)
 - Fixed key shortcut handling for left out icons. Now it is no longer possible to
   delete shortcuts since Ambient would want to delete the target. It probably should
   allow deleting shortcuts but it needs some work... (itix)

25.07.2016
 - Fixed Makedir rexx command to return error code. (itix)
 - Implemented CreateDrawerA() to workbench.library. (itix)

23.07.2016
 - Fixed %i option in status bar. Somehow exdir() didn't count icons but after tweaking
   code it does. (itix)
 - In icon view abort drag'n drop when right mouse button is pressed. (itix)
 - It is now possible Put Away shortcuts from main menu (was already possible from
   context menu). (itix)

19.03.2016
 - When editing datetime in listers date and time are always in dd-mm-yyyy HH:MM:SS
   format. This fixes issues with 12 hour clock format. (itix)

04.03.2016
 - In listers datetime column is now right aligned and when editing date it
   is temporarily converted to a numeric format. (itix)

03.03.2016
 - Fixed a bug in device list where an icon was missing and replaced
   with (somewhat) random text. (itix)
 - Changed window titles. They now show complete path (if not too long) and
   disk space is shown only on the root. (itix)
 - Enabled date substitution in lister. (itix)
 - Fixed progress window to not appear in front of more important dialogs.
   This was fixed by implementing an internal list for progress windows. (itix)

14.02.2016
 - Fixed bug where old image contents were left to the image buffer. (itix)

29.01.2016
 - Removed obsolete inline edit options. (itix)

26.01.2016
 - Implemented inline editing of protection attributes. (itix)

25.01.2016
 - Fixed NULL read when editing file data and eliminated some dead code. (itix)

24.01.2016
 - Date and time is now editable in the lister mode. (itix)

23.01.2016
 - Ambient now uses in-place editing API in lister. This allows better editing
   capabilities in the future. (itix)

09.01.2016
 - Fixed #2798, when using inline filename edit and moving up/down from cursor keys
   inline edit mode was not continued (it only worked with comment editing). (itix)

07.01.2016
 - Fixed #2348, part II. Layout was messed up on window settings page when resized
   very small. (itix)

06.01.2016
 - It is now possible create an entire directory tree using makedir command.
   Path length limits were also removed from Makedir dialog except that
   new dirtree can be up to 2048 characters long (MUI doesn't allow arbitrary
   length for string input objects). Localized error requesters in makedir. (itix)
 - Fixed an issue with ".info" files when renaming, deleting or viewing an icon
   info. Due to a bug ".info" filename could be truncated to "" causing problems
   with file operations. (itix) 

02.01.2016
 - Use NumericString for numeric gadgets. (itix)

25.12.2015
 - Fixed #2348. Layout was messed up when keyboard shortcuts page was resized
   small. (itix)

23.12.2015
 - Added missing close button to rename window. (geit)

21.12.2015
 - Added missing close button to file pattern input. (geit)

20.12.2015
 - Fixed #2663. The alpha blending did not work properly in toolbar images anymore. (itix)

01.10.2015
 - Fixed #1599 (deiconify image view). (itix)

31.10.2015
 - Fixed bubble help check to not read from illegal address as enabled by
   AppWindow changes. (itix)

26.10.2015
 - Moved AppWindow list to workbench.library. This solves race issues with MUI dialogs
   needing AppWindow functionality used in Ambient. This fixes #2174. (itix)

25.10.2015
 - Fixed progress bar in file copy and changed copy method to use ReadAsyncPkt() call.
   Asyncio.library V51 is required. (itix)

24.10.2015
 - Fixed image loading to take alpha channel into account. Such images are now
   blitted against black background. (itix)

21.10.2015
 - Added ARexx command SetPrefs/GetPrefs/SavePrefs. Command format is as follow:
   'SetPrefs KEY VALUE' where KEY is a string based on DSI_xxx define minus DSI_ prefix
   'GetPrefs KEY' where KEY is the same as SetPrefs.
   'SavePrefs': save the settings (tcheko)

03.10.2015
 - Deficonlist was not initialized when the icon column in lister mode was
   hidded. This could cause Ambient to crash when window was iconified. (itix)

10.09.2015
 - When specifing a directory as background image no error requesters
   are spilled when loading fails, as this causes annoying trouble
   (tons of requesters) in low memory situations. (geit)

26.08.2015
 - Removed get_screen dependency in Application_CenterBackground. (tcheko)

25.08.2015
 - Fixed backgound fading. (tcheko)

15.08.2015
 - Changed how bitmap modulo is calculated. This may have effect to image
   handling. (itix)
 - Possible problem found from reggae picture loading. Changed image copy
   routine what seems to stop random memory trashing. Loading images take
   longer but it can be optimized later. (itix)
 - Changed bitmap cloning to use screen pointer instead of LockPubScreen()
   (itix)

14.08.2015
 - Fixed to not display "sort by..." menu when in lister mode. It was never
   meant to work with listers and it never did. (itix)
 - Fixed possible (very rare) race condition when adding or removing threads.
   (itix)
 - Fixed possible race condition when loading multiple reggae objects in threads
   could lead to crash. (itix)

12.08.2015
 - When rotating background images there is now transition effect using simple
   alpha blending. (itix)

11.08.2015
 - Changed threading code to use threadpool.library. If you get any issues
   with it you can switch back to original threading code by changing
   USE_THREADPOOL to 0 in config.h. Using threadpool.library conserves some
   memory and reduces complexity of code. (itix)

06.04.2015
 - iconclass.c
   Fixed deficons system to display second image. (itix)

20.01.2015
 - copyright.h
   COPYRIGHTYEAR_END is 2015 now. (cyfm)

18.01.2015
 - Fixed doslist cache to work properly with large (>=2^32 block) volumes. Fixes
   icon info capacity display for such volumes. (piru)

29.04.2014
 - not so fixed bug #1741. Floattext approch renders the requester somewhat visually
   broken. Trying a 'smarter' way by splitting the string. A bit hackish as it relies
   on MUIM_Show to gather font and screen width. And it also needs a group InitChange
   ExitChange2 for relayouting the window content. A bit of improvement is possible
   by splitting text on favorite chars like '/' or ' ' instead of cutting blindly in 
   the middle of the string.  

26.04.2014
 - Fixed bug #1741. Long filepath/name no more triggers the MUI small font fallback
   when window content can't fit. (tcheko)
 - Added new name_build_sysify() function which replaces device and volume names by
   SYS:, which is handy when cloning system or renaming partitions. (geit)
 - PanelGroup Background is now using a dynamic name buffer and path gets sysified
   (geit)
 - PanelBaseButton now gets sysified, too (geit)

11.11.2013
 - appclass.c/h classes.h
   Added a new method to retrieve mimetype and deficon path of a given file (it should
   be used to avoid code duplication in other places).
   Added two new REXX commands: GetMimeType and GetDeficonPath. (fab1)

08.08.2012
 - Killed the old traylib system as it was never used by anyone beside me and disabled
   by default. (geit)
 - Removed traylib related strings from locale stuff. (geit)

03.08.2012
 - Synced new panel system invented by Kronos. Still needs some work! (List tree
   in prefs still can be confused by delete/adding) (geit)
 - Removed obsolete locale strings and resorted the recently added. (geit)

09.06.2012
 - added missing translation to toobargroup.c, updated ambient.cd accordingly
   (tcheko)

20.05.2012
 - classes.h, iconviewclass.c, metadata.c, metadata.h, threads.c, threads.h
   Fixed Ambient to not crash when deleting files in iconview mode while Ambient
   thread was scanning files subject to delete. (itix)

01.12.2011
 - iconclass.c prefs.h prefswin_listerclass.c appclass.c updatelist.c
   Added some options to refine which view/viewmodes should be applied when
   a window is not snapshot. Default view (list/icon) and mode (icons/all files/thumbs)
   can be defined. The inheritance of the view mode in iconview can also be enabled/disabled.

 - listviewclass.c prefs.c/h prefswin_windowclass.c appclass.c updatelist.c
   The selection method in list mode is now configurable: multiselect_default
   and multiselect_always are available.

30.11.2011
 - textviewclass.c imageviewclass.c
   Fixed the deadly crash happening in text and image views since quite some
   time. It was caused by infinite ping pong between viewclass and
   imageviewclass/textviewclass when getting MA_View_ShowDevices attribute. (fab1)

11.11.2011
 - removed the libmemblock dependency of non-legacy build. libmemblock wasn't
   really used anyway, only memclr() call in a few places. (chainq)

08.10.2011
 - rexx.c
   Fixed REXX stem support. (fab1)

14.07.2011
 - iconviewclass.c
   Ambient now respects bubble help setting to (not) show meta data. However,
   help key and delay setting is still ignored. (itix)

07.05.2011
 - locale/ambient.magyar.ct
   translated a few strings used in listview (chainq)

05.01.2011
 - deficonpool.c
   Bookmarks deficon object was replaced by view deficon. (fab1)
 - contextmenu.c iconclass.c listviewclass.c
   Add support for global actions when multiple files/dirs are selected. (fab1)

11.07.2010
 - appclass.c
   For REXX file operations always demand absolute path. (itix)
 - menus.c, menus.h, viewclass.c, windowclass.c
   Killed "Paste Into..." from menustrip. Ambient now toggles menuitem title
   ("Paste" or "Paste Into...") on context. (itix)

10.07.2010
 - appclass.c, listviewlistclass.c, viewclass.c
   Fixed Ambient to not perform Paste operation in device window. (itix)

06.07.2010
 - classes.h, viewclass.c, viewclass.h
   Added MA_View_SelectionMask tag. Returns type mask of selected icons. (itix)
 - keyshortcuts.c, keyshortcuts.h
   Before executing keyboard shortcut make sure operation is possible with
   selected icons. (itix)

26.06.2010
 - recognition.db
   - added application/x-gba-rom: Nintendo® Game Boy Advance ROM Image. (piru)
   - added application/x-nds-rom: Nintendo® DS Game ROM Image. (piru)
   - added application/x-amigaos-whdload: WHDLoad Slave. (piru)

16.01.2010
 - viewclass.c
   Disable cut/copy/paste when they should not be used. (itix)

15.01.2010
 - iconviewclass.c
   save_shortcuts was always initialized to TRUE causing Ambient to save
   shortcuts.prefs when DOS notification was triggered. (itix)

10.01.2010
 - iconviewclass.c
   Fixed a bug where shortcuts disappeared from the desktop after reboot if
   they were renamed. Shortcuts are now saved if filename notification is
   triggered on a shortcut icon. (itix)

29.11.2009
 - sysinfowinclass supports multiple cpus now (laire)

29.06.2009
 - iconviewclass.c, listviewclass.c, listviewlistclass.c
   Use StrnCmp() for proper sorting of strings. (itix)

15.06.2009
 - appclass.c/h contextmenu.c/h iconclass.c
   added contextmenu with "Open" entry for appicons. (fab1)

28.05.2009
 - movedir.c movefile.c rename.c
   don't abort "move" process when pressing skip/skip all if source and destination are located
   on the same volume. (fab1) 

18.11.2008
 - screen.c,screen.h,main.c
   screen is locked untill ambient enters main loop. (kiero)

10.11.2008
 - wblib/appicon.c
   set initial value for loadedentry flag. (kiero)
 - ipc.c
   fixed cleanup code (kiero)

07.11.2008
 - appclass.c,appicon.c,ipc.c,wblib/appicon.c
   more work on asynchronous appicon handling. (kiero)

06.11.2008
 - wblib/appicon.c,ipc.c,appicon.c
   adding and removing of appicons is now asynchronous. (kiero)

19.10.2008
 - deletefile.c, deletedir.c
   added locale support (geit)

17.10.2008
 - selectwinclass.c
   added locale support (geit)

16.10.2008
 - name.c
   name_build_noinfo(): only strip "disk" of disk.info if preceeded by a colon. (piru)
 - recognition.db
   - added application/x-sgixfs: SGI XFS FileSystem. (piru)
   - added application/x-linuxswap: Linux Swap File. (piru)
   - added application/x-linuxkernel: Linux Kernel File. (piru)
   - added application/x-fatfs: FAT FileSystem. (piru)
   - added application/x-hfsfs: Hierarchical File System. (piru)

06.10.2008
 - added missing stack usage in Application_NewShell method. (geit)
 - doslistcache.c devices.c rename.c prefs_desktop.c
   Attempt to fix duplicate volume sometimes appearing on volume renaming (should also work
   for filesystems such as SMBFS or FFS that send DISKINSERTED on renaming). Also restored
   DLC_DEAD node state usage in doslistcache before DLC_REMOVED transition. (fab1)

29.08.2008
 - Round bus and CPU MHz up. (piru)

15.08.2008
 - config.h
   enabled glowicons32 support again. (fab1)
 - clickpathclass.c vfs.c/h listviewclass.c iconviewclass.c mimeuri.c toolbutton_historyclass.c
   xad and iso files now show the browsed file name in clickpath/window
   title instead of cryptic @x:.
   Parent command also adjusted to return to file directory instead of
   showing my morphos. (fab1)

30.07.2008
 - recognition.db
   added AC3D filetype (requested by Herbert Klackl)
   (tokai)

28.07.2008
 - recognition.db
   added 'Extract with UnRAR...' action to RAR filetype
   (tokai)

24.07.2008
 - vfs.c
   don't leak fscontext anymore since pending lock issue in
   fscontext/xadfs is now gone. (fab1)
 - listviewclass.c
   defer listviewentryobjects disposal during deletion process if a thread that
   could reference them is still active. Fixes some mui debug or even potential
   crash if someone deletes files while icons are still being displayed. (fab1)
 - progresswinclass.c move*.c/h delete*.c fastcopy.c/h makedir.c classes.h
   since progresswindow refresh is not done at each fastcopy call anymore,
   "total size already copied" information shown in progresswindow was
   actually wrong (lower than what it really was). Thus this information
   is now updated differently. (fab1)

20.07.2008
 - recognition.db
   added MorphOS 2.0 default actions for sound filetypes supported by
   datatypes or Reggae (AIFF, WAVE, 8svx, ...)
   (tokai)
 - toolbargroup.c, prefs.c, prefswin_windowclass.c
   Enabled/ completed support for toolbarbutton look configuration.
   It's now possible to choose custom background too (or give buttons
   a proper borderless look).

   NOTE: As the settings item existed already and was stored as empty 
   string, it might look a bit weird (buttons are transparent) when Ambient 
   gets restarted for the first time and such 'broken' configuration exists 
   already (an empty string is a valid ImageSpec, so this cannot be 
   workarounded). Just go to 'Ambient Prefs > Windows' and (re)configure the 
   Background.
   (tokai)
 - prefswin_mainclass.c updatelist.c strap.c appclass.c classes.h
   Attempt to fix the infamous cancel bug that could trash toolbar/listers and co. (fab1)
   -> _conf() members wouldn't be refreshed after cancel, even though string addresses
	  could be reallocated. Now they are all refreshed even after cancel, so it should be
	  safe.
 - devices.c
   capacity info updating thread won't lock doslistcache when possibly blocking operations are happening. (kiero)
 - iconviewclass.c
   don't abort devices_show thread when not needed. (kiero)
 - recognition.db
   fixed 'Extract To...' action for Lha filetype (thanks to Herbert Klackl for reporting) (tokai)
 - aboutwinclass.c
   www.simdtech.org has expired, use the wikipedia altivec article instead. (piru)

13.07.2008
 - mimetypes.c
   added function to free data allocated by mimetype_gettypesarray(). (kiero)
 - mimelisttreeclass.c
   don't leak memory allocated by mimetype_gettypesarray(). (kiero)
 - recognition.db
   - added default actions for .bz2 and tar.bz2 using Bz2 command
   - added MusiFile MPEG Layer-2 Audio format recognition
   (tokai)

10.07.2008
 - toolbargroup.c
   fixed possible (highly) crash when dragging toolbar buttons (kiero)

09.07.2008
 - clickpathclass.c, toolbarclass.c
   some layout cosmetics for the browser mode toolbar
 - appclass.c, classes.h, menu.c
   dispose non-legacy 'About MorphOS' window when closed.
   (tokai)
 - devices.c, doslistcache.c, iconviewclass.c
   reworked the way driveinfo is updated. now there is only one thread updating
   entries on doslistcache and signaling views to update their icons. (kiero)

08.07.2008
 - iconviewclass.c
   avoid mouse pointer 'blocking' when removing a metainfo help bubble.
   (tokai)

06.07.2008
 - images/shourtcut.png, appicon.png
   added new appicon identifier image, matching shortcut arrow.
   (tokai)

14.06.2008
 - c/open/main.c
   Added smart URL detection to Ambients Open command. This will avoid
   unwanted web browser launches due misspelled file names. (geit)
 - listviewlistclass.c
   Added missing locales for assign and link.

08.06.2008
 - rename.c
   Added missing unable to rename strings (geit)

05.06.2008
 - iconviewclass.c
   volume rename handling (in internal notify) was completely broken. (kiero)

26.05.2008
 - iconviewclass.c, lasso.c|h
   don't leave trash from lasso when background image is loaded (kiero)

24.05.2008
 - infowinclass.c, formatclass.c
   moved checkboxed to be uniform on the left side. (geit)
 - formatclass.c
   added missing underscore support (geit)

22.05.2008
 - prefswin_listerclass.c, prefswin_windowclass.c, mimegroupclass.c
   moved checkboxed to be uniform on the left side. (geit)
   removed useless groups and made some cleanups. (geit)
 - prefswin_windowclass.c
   "position window under mouse" checkbox is no longer blocking
   window sizing the "get from window" button. (geit)

15.05.2008
 - keyshortcuts.c
   enabled missing SHORTCUT_ID_FIND in keyboard settings. (geit)

10.05.2008
 - cxwinclass.c panelitem_listclass.c panelitemwinclass.c
