   fixed a race condition (a thread would not always restart when many were aborted simultaneously).
   added notify on device rename/mount/unmount in device list and enabled rename again for devices. (fab1)
 - command.h contextmenu.c listviewclass.c
   AS_ASSIGN flag added for assigns, to filter unsuitable actions in menus (delete, rename, ...). (fab1)
 - keyshortcuts.c
   hotkeys now also works on rootview. (fab1)
 - appclass.c
   adjusted to make rename work on devices when called from an action (basicly handling
   unexpected ':'. (fab1)
 - progresswinclass.c
   delayed opening steals focus when deleting files. Disabled. (fab1)
 - keyshortcuts.c/h appclass.c
   added more default actions for shortcuts: mode/submode and find hotkeys. (fab1)
 - listviewclass.c listviewlistclass.c
   inline rename also works for devices. (fab1)
 - appclass.c
   another aproach to make bugfree threaded object disposal. hopefully last one:) (kiero)
 - iconviewclass.c
   icons added to view (via copy/move/etc) are now given proper deficon or thumbnail.
   adding icons in thumbnail mode didn't refresh the view. (kiero)

21.06.2006
 - recognition.db
   added matching for ID3 tags to audio/mpeg (tokai)
 - action.c
   added action duplication function, and temporary actions. (kiero)
 - actiondispatcher.c
   added support for temporary actions. they are disposed when execution finishes (kiero)
 - toolbutton_actionclass.c
   use temporary actions (kiero)

20.06.2006
 - prefswin_windowclass.c
   Removed the useless text field gadgets with their even more useless underscore
   selection and cleaned the entire stuff a little. Also fixed the disabling mechanism
   when open under mouse is activated. (geit)
 - iconclass.c
   launch with default tool from paths with spaces (e.g. Ram Disk:) works again 
   (tokai)
 - wbstartup.c: very long path or defaulttool no longer can trash innocent memory,
   modified to dynamically allocate space for strings. (itix)
 - iconio.c
   for lonely icons MV_Icon_FileType_File is set as filetype, instead of MV_Icon_FileType_None.
   Fixes the drop of lonely icons on icons in iconview. (fab1)
 - appicon.c
   MA_Icon_FileType is set to MV_Icon_FileType_None to ensure appicons won't be accepted in drop
   operations. (fab1)
 - iconviewclass.c
   dragquery only accepts MA_Icon_FileType returning MV_Icon_FileType_File/Directory/Device values. (fab1)
 - listviewlistclass.c clickpathbuttonclass.c
   dragquery only accepts MA_Icon_FileType returning MV_Icon_FileType_File/Directory values. (fab1)
 - panelgroupclass.c panelbuttonclass.c
   dragquery rejects MV_Icon_Type_AppIcon. (fab1)
 - infoicongroupclass.c
   dragquery doesn't accept MV_Icon_FileType_None filetype. (fab1)
 - doslistcache.c devices.c
   when a device/volume is set to DLC_REMOVED, its device/volume pair is searched and set to DLC_REMOVED,
   so that devices/volumes pairs are both removed from dostlistcache. Seems to fix problems with
   inserted/reinserted USB devices for instance and also with renamed volumes. DLC_DEAD is unused now,
   i wonder if it had any real use. Please test in case it would break something. (fab1)

19.06.2006
 - makefile, include/vapor/macros.h
   smarter way to activate inlining of mui methods for final release build without 
   the need of global -fno-inline (tokai)
 - toolbutton_actionclass.c
   removed memory leak at dispose. (kiero)
 - Install, recognition.db
   audio/flac -> audio/x-flac (tokai)
 - */lib.c, c/*/main.c, parserexx.doc, tcrypt.c, timeout_create.c
   removed unnecessary 'by' from version tags, updated then with new dates and info 
