 - keyshortcutclass.c keyshortcuts.c/h prefswin_keyboardclass.c classes.c/h prefswin.h
   prefswin_mainclass.c prefs.c/h updatelist.c appclass.c viewclass.c viewgroupclass.c
   Added global hotkey support. Some builtin actions are configurable. Later, when action
   editor is done, hotkeys for custom actions will also be configurable. (fab1)
 - rename.c
   don't delete destination file if source file doesn't exist anymore. (fab1)
 - appclass.c toolbargroup.c
   clipboardpaste behaviour is modified to paste to view path only when TO is not supplied. (fab1)

17.06.2006
 - zstartup.c/callmain(): GCC3 fix from Gunther Nikl (GCC3 doesnt support multiline
