16.06.2006
 - makefile
   Forgot "Do" to be released in nightly builds. (geit)
 - makefile
   updated help text (tokai)
 - Install
   optionally install "Do" command (tokai)
 - pedantic: moved wblib/objects.c note from this file to wblib/workbench.notes (itix)
