05.06.2006
 - config.h iconviewclass.c classes.h contextmenu.c
   added USE_AUTOSNAPSHOT config option, enabled by default. When disabled, snapshot
   is displayed in icon menu, so as to manually snapshot. Will be changed to a runtime
   option, later. (fab1)
 - iconclass.c command.h contextmenu.c appclass.c
   mymorphos icon has now a dedicated flag for context menus (AS_MYCOMPUTER), so as
   to remove inappropriate entries for this item. (fab1)
 - recognition.db, Install
   - added application/vnd.ms-cab-compressed, application/x-truetypecollection and
     image/x-imagefx
   - fixed matching for matroska files
   - added matching for Sony Ericsson's ULR files to Internet Shortcut matching
   - changed application/msexcel to application/vnd.ms-excel and application/x-powerpoint
     to application/vnd.ms-powerpoint to match official IANA registrations. If you have
     deficons or custom filetypes for these types you must rename the according files.   
   - tweaked matching for text/html, text/x-php and audio/mpeg.
   (tokai)

02.06.2006
 - deficonpool.c/make_default_icon(): fixed memory leak. Deficon cache for device
   icons was not working (intentionally or accidentally by chaozer? see revision 1.2
   from the CVS) but perhaps it was not useful? Either way the cache is now disabled by
   the #define USE_DEVICEICON_CACHE 0 on the top of the file. (itix)
 - config.h,  mimetype.c, prefs_advanced.c
   moved USE_MIME_NOFALLBACKNAME config options to advanced prefs (tokai)
 - prefs_advanced.c
   - do not switch to struct MinList, when struct List members are used! 
   - added some prioritys for more frequently used options 
   (tokai)
 - distribution/prefs/Advanced.conf,default
   documented options which moved from prefs to advanced prefs recently (tokai)
 - makefile.rules
   find tcrypt command again (tokai)
 - name.c/name_check_quoted(): removed warning and fixed to check both quotation mark
   from both ends. (itix)
 - makefile
   readded workaround to pass CPU-TYPES variable to the makefiles of the subdirs,
   this is required so e.g. "make archive-final" works as expected and doesnt
   use debug build objects/ binaries. (tokai)
 - wbstartup.c: a deprecated tooltype MOSDONOTSTART is now alias to new tooltype
   DONOTSTART. Implemented new tooltype WBSTARTDELAY -- user can specify how many
   seconds Ambient should wait for WBStartup program (bug: waits even when program
   quits!) and removed really stupid DONOTWAIT tooltype. If you must wait please use
   WBSTARTDELAY for now on (maybe if no parameter it could wait like Workbench does
   without DONOTWAIT tooltype?). (itix)
 - wbstartup.c/tr_wbstartup_execute(): display "Starting %s..." on the tilte bar only
   if Ambient waits for program. Otherwise user wouldnt see a thing. (itix)

