18.04.2006
 - main.c, appclass.c, config.h
   Enabled Shutdown option in Ambient shutdown request when using MOS 1.5 and a
   legacy build. (geit)
 - recog.c
   Fixed a bug in recogcmd_match(). Passed offset was ignored because of a strlen/sizeof
   confusion.
   Made recognition loop a bit smarter : it now stops evaluation in parenthesed groups
   as soon as it can. (fab1)
 - mimetype.c
   Disabled FindString used for OS4 executable recognition. It really slows down too
   much, especially when big (unknown) files are scanned. (fab1)
 - listviewclass.c
   Fixed image trash bug in icons/thumbnails retrieved from cache. (fab1)
 - appclass.h actioneditclass.c
   Reordered commands id in rexxcmd array as actionedit relies on that. Also removed
   hardcoded rexxcmd numeric offsets in actioneditclass.c. (fab1)
 - recog.c: use cached examine. use ITERATELISTSAFE. (piru)
 - catmaker.c: don't use silly fixed offset of 8 to node, but offsetof(). don't nuke if
   runs out of memory. various other small cleanups. (piru)
 - locale.c: bumped catalog version to 2. (piru)
 - catmaker.c: fixed strcpy with overlapping src and dst. added some missing backslash
   formatting codes (b, c, e, f, g, t and v). added overflow checking to octal (\000).
   allocate label dynamically aswell. (piru)
 - catmaker2.c: write header file #define's in .cd file order. all error messages are
   output to stderr now, so you can see why something barfs even when using quiet build.
   as catmaker doesn't currently support specifying msg IDs, throw an error if .cd file
   uses it. added /a (bell).  (piru)
