28.03.2006
 - appclass.c
   removed annoying 'no mimetype for...' window (kiero)
 - listview*.c/h classes.h viewapi.c viewgroupclass.c iconclass.c iconviewclass.c
   findresultlistclass.c
   Finished all/icons/thumbs submodes support in listviewclass.
   uri template had to be changed : 'list' is not passed in 'mode' parameter anymore, but in a new 'view'
   parameter instead. Example : file://ram:?view=list&mode=thumbs will show listview in thumbnail submode.
   These submodes can be snapshot. Snapshot now also saves sort column and direction.
   As some values have changed, you may have to delete envarc:ambient.data to avoid some inconsistencies
   in previously snapshot listers. (fab1)

27.03.2006
 - iconviewclass.c/listviewclass.c
   added some new generic methods for file-views. (kiero)
