   same here. ready to work with iconview too (kiero).

26.03.2006
 - Makefile
   archive names follow common standard now (tokai)
 - aboutwinclass.c
   added Ocinel (tokai)
 - viewgroupclass.c
   fixed initial viewmode handling. (kiero)
 - mimetype.c
   now all types from recognition.db are added. even if they don't have actions
   defined.
   loading of user filetypes from subdirectories too (filetypes/audio/ f.ex.) (kiero)
