   Match block has to be defined. The actions defined in this descriptor will be added to icon
   and listview contextmenu, for any file (the way it's displayed in menu is not definitive).
   For example, think about a "edit" or "compact to..." action. (fab1)
 - iconviewclass.c/thumbs.c
   changed object position querying to workaround 16bit limiations in mui. (kiero)

25.03.2006
