   changing view/mode updates it also in mimeurictx, so querying it will result in corect result (kiero)

22.03.2006
 - listview*.c/h getdirsize.c typecanner.c findver.c appclass.c prefs.c/h threads.c classes.h
   + Added progressive display for icon, version, filetype, dir size columns. Still needs improvement
     (updating visible items first, like in iconview thumbs).
   + Links entries display the target in comment field.
   + Fixed a refresh issue when dropping files on directories. It was sometimes not cleared.
   + Size field for directories is either "Directory" or "..."/size when getdirsizes is running.
   + Added prefs items : default size, default format, assign display, compact size display,
     bold directories. They'll appear later in prefs/lister.
   + Fixed a race condition in threads.c : SIGBREAKF_CTRL_C is now cleared at thread start too,
     otherwise threads could sometimes abort immediately.
   + Reworked inline renaming : now file is renamed if up/down are pressed or if a new item is
     selected with middle button.
   (fab1)
 - iconviewclass.c
   Enabled "doubleclick on desktop". May change later when events are configurable. (fab1)
 - progresswinclass.c
   Removed opening 1s delay in non legacy build. (fab1)

21.03.2006
 - makefile.objs, classes.c: removed devicelistclass from the build as unused. (itix)
 - listviewlistclass.c
   Fixed the ugly and empty icon title to show a proper image in list title. The context menu
   also shows this image instead of the very bad "Column 2" stuff. (geit)
   Cleaned the title creation loops to be faster and better readable. (geit)
 - parserexxdoc.c
   Removed some () warnings and added attributes to remove unused errors. (geit)

20.03.2006
 - listview*.c/h classes.h threads.c/h capacity.c/h contextmenu.c/h getdirsize.c/h
   file_func.c/h clipboard.c move*.c rename.c appclass.c mimetype.c
   + Added 2 entries to listview's title contextmenu : "Get directories sizes", and
   "Reset to default format".
   + Fixed capacity_format_size_separated bug for big sizes.
   + Fixed a bug with recursive check when dropping dirs on themselves.
   + Moving inside listview is faster (view is only refreshed at the end), which fixes a refresh
     issue as well.
   + When dropping a file with ALT pressed, behaviour is inverted : if file had to be
     copied, it's moved, and vice-versa.
   + If clipboard's paste list was empty (can happen if entries are skipped because of recursion),
     move function was called anyway, and "from" path was trashed. Fixed.
   + Removed harmless error requester when moving an iconless dir to the same partition (icon was
     always expected).
   + Moved threads management in functions to make listview code a bit cleaner.
   (fab1)
