   listviewlistclass.c iconviewclass.c rename*.c/h toolbargroup.c prefs.c/h actiondispatcher.c
   Added 'noinfo' mode to rename and copy/move clipboard commands. Whether icon will
   be linked to processed file or not is decided by window's view type. In icon mode,
   icon is always handled, and in list mode, it depends of 'DSI_FASTLIST_HANDLE_ICONS'
   pref item (which is for now not configurable thru preferences). (fab1)
 - toolbargroup.c
   Added Find built-in command. (fab1)
 - move*.c fastcopy.c
   Added some additional checks to copy operation. Copy abortion is also now handled :
   no more error requester when a copy is aborted. (fab1)


05.02.2006
 - listviewclass.c listviewlistclass.c
   Added column state (order/hidden-shown/iconsize) saving when snapshooting window. 
   If something goes wrong, delete envarc:ambient.data. :) (fab1)
 - rename.c
   Filenames couldn't be renamed if only case was changed. fixed. (fab1)
 - iconviewclass.c/layout.c
   Snapping to grid is now only enabled if ALT is pressed.
   Moving of multiple icons was broken. They started to displace.
   No unneded refresh when dropping icons to same view (non-root).
   Number of selected items is zeroed when view is disposed. (kiero)
 - textbox.c
   Added bitmap caching. Speeds up slphashadow labels rendering considerably. (kiero)

03.02.2006
 - listview*.c/h classes.h 
   Added listview format parsing, to prepare column settings per path.
   Added notifications on columns contextual menus. It's now possible to
   enable/disable icon/filetype/version columns dynamically. (fab1)
 - scandir.c
   Really fixed links issue now:) (kiero)
 - doslistcache.c prefs_desktop.c
   There was still an issue when removing drives. I hope this is fixed this time ! (fab1)
 - cache.c
   Implemented invalidation function (selected entries, tags or all).
