 - thumbs.c
   Improved hashing function. Will detect file overwrites. (kiero)
 - typescanner.c
   Added type caching. (kiero)
 - mimetype.c
   Added cached mimetypes invalidation when reloading recognition database. (kiero)

02.02.2006
 - prefs_desktop.c
   tr_hiddendrives_updatedevice() expects a device name, but is receives
   a volume name. It's now translated to device name. (fab1)
 - listview*.c/h classes.h findver.c/h threads.c/h
   Reworked threads handling in listview. please test and stress it.
   Added mimetypes and version columns to listers. As these operations
   are time-consuming, it's hidden (and unfilled) until listers prefs
   are available. If you want to enable them, edit listview.c/386-387 and set
   list format accordingly in listview.h. (fab1)
 - scandir.c
   Better handling of softlinks. In iconview they have proper icon if point to
