 - listviewlistclass.c
   Adjusted compare function to handle small modification in softlink handling.
   (dirsize == -1). Proper sorting of directory softlinks (kiero)

01.02.2006
 - descparser.c
   Loading of multiple descriptors from single file. More robust. (kiero)
 - descsaver.c
   Saving descriptors without recognition block. (kiero)
 - appclass.c
   DOSNotify handling of recognition routines database. (kiero)
 - viewgroup.c/viewclass.c
   MM_View_InvalidateMimeType added. Invalidates given (or all) mimetypes in
   all items of view. (kiero)
 - mimetype.c
   Loading of external recognition routines database, including reloading
   when file contents change. Minor cleanups.
