   Added 'external' flag. (kiero)
 - iconviewclass.c
   Handling of left/top/width/height params for Devices:// mode. (kiero)
 - init.c
   DOSNotify is initialized earlier. (kiero)
 - clickpathclass.c
   Fixed spacing between path and right arrow. (kiero)

