10.12.2005
 - listviewclass.c listviewlistclass.c classes.h appclass.c panelwinclass.c panelgroupclass.c wbarg.c
    + Reorganized listview icon stuff in dedicated methods.
    + Added default images (def_tool, def_drawer, def_disk) while loading icons in
      listview to avoid jumpy effect.
    + Listview selection is now much faster.
    + Listview now reacts on prefs changes. Potential (crash) bug with color to bitmap
      change though, related to statusbar.
    + Improvements in listview drag'n'drop :
      - no more wrong destination drop with overlapped windows
      - custom dropmark : directories are colored with drop tint preference.
      - adding on entry on panel
      - passing argument to panel (even multiple)
      - dropping on appwindow
      - drag'n'drop in same lister is not allowed if destination is not a directory
