   Fixed icon bitmap caching. Intermediate effect buffers are disposed always
   when gfx state changes (MOUSEOVER, SELECTED). Not sure is this good approach
   because we could dispose gfx buffer in MUIM_Draw immediately after gfx is
   blitted. Sigh. Zapek overdesigned Ambient. (itix)

