28.08.2005
 - iconviewclass.c
   Fixed broken rendering when icon hover was not used (bubbles were not cleared,
   icons were highlighted still) (itix)
 - iconclass.c
   Made some memory saving optimizations. Special state images are deleted when
   corresponding attribute is cleared (MA_Icon_Highligted for example). This saves
   considerable amount of memory. In addition rendering code now actually uses
   prebuffered special state images (changed create_specialbm() to do so) and
   should save some cpu cycles too. (itix)

